        <p>They must learn to outgrow the growth of this antag- onism if they would understand the Christian spirit in all its grandeur and purity, in the fullness ,f its signifi-; cance for human life. LEOH-ST. BAPTIST SUNDAY SCHOOL The anniversary sermons of the above Sunday school were preached on Sunday, by Mr. Alexander, of Birken- head. There were good congregations, and the the col- lections realised £ll Os. Id. - ST. MARY'S CHURCH, GREAT SANKEY._</p>
