        <p>LOCAL NEWS.</p>
        <p>POACHLING AT DITTON. At Widnes Petty Sessions on Thursday, Richard Hes- wick and George Hunt, both of Ditton were o,nvicted of poaching on land.in the occupstion of John FAwardsan, farmer, on the 16th inst. Beswick, an old offender, was fined 40s. and costs, and Hunt, who made hies first ap- pearance, ss. and costs.</p>
