        <p>- - JOSEPH PRITCHARD, Watchmaker and Jeweller, 51, High- et.. and 4, Bridge et., Runcorn.—Advt. A SPREE ASSAULT CASE.</p>
        <p>At the Widnes Police Court, on Monday, before Mr. H. Wade Deacon, a labourer, named Henry Birchen, of Speke, was charged in custody with assaulting a married woman, named Isabella Burgess,wife of Joseph Burgess, 11, Stanley-street, Garston, in Speke-road, Speke, about seven o'clock on Sunday night. The prisoner, who denied the offence, was committed for trial. If you wantyour watch repaired by skilful workmen. take to PRITCHLRIAL—Advt.</p>
