        <p>HARI TINESDAY.--Befort Messrs. Hera DRUNK AND Dm. Aston, and Mlchat were each fined 5a.. disorderly at Preston CICLISTS FINED.—J rington a fitter, was a bicycle without a lan Acton Grange. Williat cham, for riding a bicyc the Bth April was fined 1, DOG OwNEeS IN TAO Hall-street, Warrington, three dogs to be at large March, without having the lon the collar. He was fii Taylor, labourer, Wincham large at Sevenoaks on the 14 penalty. For havin., adog wi. March, Henry White, laboure. was also fined is. and costs.</p>
