        <p>THE NEW BATHS.-.-THS_OTT DarzaßzrA orENINo.</p>
        <p>Councillor Dixon will ask the chairman of the Baths, brc., Committee 44 if he will itx a date when the New Baths will be opened for the use of the public." The Baths Committee recommend that the Water Committee be requested to lay on Appleton' water to the New Baths and the Water Commitiee have &amp;cid ed that the'baths be supplied with Appleton water, at 3d. per 1,000 gal- lons.</p>
